''
'' IBM PC BASIC SOUND note example.
''
'' GW-BASIC, BASICA, QBasic, QuickBASIC and BASIC PDS use SOUND
'' frequency,duration, with frequency in hertz and duration in 18.2 Hz timer
'' ticks.  This plays middle C for about one second.
''
'' Source:
''   https://hwiegman.home.xs4all.nl/gw-man/SOUND.html
''

#lang "qb"

10 SOUND 262,18

'' end of sound_middle_c.bas
